
<section class=" cream ">
  <div
    class=" wrap "
  >
    <div
      class=" sect-head "
    >
      <div
        class=" eyebrow "
      >
        What's in the Impression Kit
      </div>
      <h2
        class=" display "
        style=" margin-top:14px "
      >
        Everything you need, plus a backup.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div
      class=" kit-strip "
    >
      <div
        class=" kit-card "
      >
        <div
          class=" kit-illu "
        >
          <svg
            viewBox=" 0 0 32 32 "
            fill=" none "
            stroke=" currentColor "
            stroke-width=" 1.6 "
            stroke-linecap=" round "
          >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <path
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    d=" M5 14 C 7 6,
            25 6,
            27 14 L26 22 H6 Z ">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Upper impression tray</h4>
        <p>Pre-sized to fit most adult arches comfortably.</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class=" kit-card "
      >
        <div
          class=" kit-illu "
        >
          <svg
            viewBox=" 0 0 32 32 "
            fill=" none "
            stroke=" currentColor "
            stroke-width=" 1.6 "
            stroke-linecap=" round "
          >
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                <path
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    d=" M5 18 C 7 26,
            25 26,
            27 18 L26 10 H6 Z ">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Lower impression tray</h4>
        <p>Same precision fit, opposite arch.</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class=" kit-card "
      >
        <div
          class=" kit-illu "
        >
          <svg
            viewBox=" 0 0 32 32 "
            fill=" none "
            stroke=" currentColor "
            stroke-width=" 1.6 "
            stroke-linecap=" round "
          >
            <circle
                cx=" 11 "
                cy=" 16 "
                r=" 6 ">
                </circle>
                    <circle
                        cx=" 21 "
                        cy=" 16 "
                        r=" 6 ">
                        </circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Dental putty (×2 batches)</h4>
        <p>Two batches included, so you have a backup if your first try doesn't go perfectly.</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class=" kit-card "
      >
        <div
          class=" kit-illu "
        >
          <svg
            viewBox=" 0 0 32 32 "
            fill=" none "
            stroke=" currentColor "
            stroke-width=" 1.6 "
            stroke-linecap=" round "
          >
            <rect
                x=" 7 "
                y=" 5 "
                width=" 18 "
                height=" 22 "
                rx=" 2 ">
                </rect>
                    <path
                        d=" M11 11h10M11 15h10M11 19h6 ">
                        </path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Instructions card</h4>
        <p>Three steps, about 5 minutes. QR code to Dr. Turley's walkthrough video if you'd rather watch than read.</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class=" kit-card "
      >
        <div
          class=" kit-illu "
        >
          <svg
            viewBox=" 0 0 32 32 "
            fill=" none "
            stroke=" currentColor "
            stroke-width=" 1.6 "
            stroke-linecap=" round "
            stroke-linejoin=" round "
          >
            <path
                d=" M4 10 L16 4 L28 10 L28 24 L4 24 Z ">
                </path>
                    <path
                        d=" M4 10 L16 16 L28 10 ">
                        </path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Prepaid return mailer</h4>
        <p>Drop it in any USPS box. No postage, no trip to the post office.</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class=" kit-card "
      >
        <div
          class=" kit-illu "
        >
          <svg
            viewBox=" 0 0 32 32 "
            fill=" none "
            stroke=" currentColor "
            stroke-width=" 1.6 "
          >
            <rect
                x=" 5 "
                y=" 8 "
                width=" 22 "
                height=" 16 "
                rx=" 2 ">
                </rect>
                    <rect
                        x=" 8 "
                        y=" 11 "
                        width=" 3 "
                        height=" 10 ">
                        </rect>
                            <rect
                                x=" 13 "
                                y=" 11 "
                                width=" 3 "
                                height=" 10 ">
                                </rect>
                                    <rect
                                        x=" 18 "
                                        y=" 11 "
                                        width=" 3 "
                                        height=" 10 ">
                                        </rect>
                                            <rect
                                                x=" 23 "
                                                y=" 11 "
                                                width=" 1.5 "
                                                height=" 10 ">
                                                </rect>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Shade matching card</h4>
        <p>A reference strip so we capture your actual tooth color, not a guess.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p
      class=" kit-note "
    >
      If your first impressions don't capture enough detail, we send a second kit free. Production doesn't start until
      we have what we need.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
  {
    "name": "Kit",
    "settings": []
  }
  {% endschema %}


